# Cloudflare static-asset response headers (copied to dist/ by Vite).
# `no-transform` on the HTML stops Cloudflare injecting its analytics beacon at the edge
# (it once did, silently, to colonel_kernel). The CSP would block it anyway; this stops the
# request being attempted. HTML only: no-transform also forbids compression.
/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-transform
/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-transform
